<title>USA: Zygo buys Sight Systems Inc.</title>
<headline>Zygo buys Sight Systems Inc.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLEFIELD, Conn. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zygo Corp said Tuesday it has acquired Sight Systems Inc in exchange for 287,400 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The transaction is to be accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>Sight Systems, located in Newbury Park, Calif., designs, develops, manufactures and markets application-specific machine vision metrology systems which are primarily used by customers in the data-storage industry.</p>
</text>
